+						/**
+						* ==== Modes ====
+						* A modeX node is required to support v4l2 driver
+						* implementation with NVIDIA camera software stack
+						*
+						* == Signal properties ==
+						*
+						* phy_mode = "";
+						* PHY mode used by the MIPI lanes for this device
